  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_9808.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333339691162px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">La noche de este domingo han finalizado las fiestas del barrio de San Joaqu&iacute;n, en Onda, donde este s&aacute;bado ha habido exhibici&oacute;n de toro y vaquillas, adem&aacute;s de dos emboladas.</span></p>\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_9965.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333339691162px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Ya domingo por la noche, tras el pasacalle por el barrio y el canto del himno se ha entonado el Pobre de m&iacute; , con encendido de bengalas.</span></span></div>\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/PobreDeMiDesfiladaFinalSantJoaquim-37.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333339691162px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">La interpretaci&oacute;n final del Silencio ha estado a cargo a cargo de un trompetista de la Xaranga Salsa Rosa.</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"></span></span></div>\n"
